{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T21:36:08.131822243Z","verse":29,"ref":"leviticus 23:29","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":23,"translation":"For any soul that is not afflicted on the very selfsame day, ⟨that soul⟩ shall be cut off from its people.","tokens":[{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"any"},{"surface":"הנפש","gloss":"soul"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"who"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תענה","gloss":"is afflicted"},{"surface":"בעצם","gloss":"on the very selfsame"},{"surface":"היום","gloss":"the day"},{"surface":"הזה","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"ונכרתה","gloss":"shall be cut off"},{"surface":"מעמיה","gloss":"from among her people"}]}